FFI: the Foreign Function Interface, calls of the functions of C
libraries from PHP, with libffi of the package az.

The module ffi of PHP 7.4 for php74 of azsupport/ports, which installs
side by side with the other versions of PHP: lib/php/20190902/ffi.so,
loaded by its ini in etc/php74/conf.d, its headers in
include/php74/php/ext/ffi.
